  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant PRIM_PHYSICS has the value 3</p>
  <p>Used to get or set the object&#39;s <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/STATUS_PHYSICS" target="_blank">physics</a> <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Category:LSL_Status" target="_blank">status</a>. When enabled the object responds to SL physics.</p>
</p>
